{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>StarHunter</strong> is a virtual reality first-person adventure shooter game where players travel to interstellar space to hunt down robots, dragons, and monsters. You will engage in fierce combat using rifles, shotguns, rocket launchers, and other weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an experienced star hunter, regularly assigned dangerous missions by the Interstellar Mining Corporation. This mission includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminating rogue robots on the lunar base</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exterminating unknown creatures aboard Transport Ship 225</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunting down the giant dragon on planet Pandora</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3529780?t=1746140485","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3529780?t=1746140485","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529780/30ff87c8075a02bd1b60a816b541ca0038097f74/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746140485","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529780/30ff87c8075a02bd1b60a816b541ca0038097f74/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746140485","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3631810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>StarHunter</strong> is a virtual reality first-person adventure shooter game where players travel to interstellar space to hunt down robots, dragons, and monsters. You will engage in fierce combat using rifles, shotguns, rocket launchers, and other weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an experienced star hunter, regularly assi